00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,260
Slide 14 explores the hardware muscle: "TPU V8: THE GREEN SUSTAINABLE MUSCLE."

2
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:15,710
When you run 50 background agents 24 hours a day, energy efficiency is a massive cost and ecological factor!

3
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:24,239
Look at Layer 1: Google's TPU v8 uses direct-to-chip liquid cooling, cutting power usage effectiveness (PUE) down to 1.10!

4
00:00:25,139 --> 00:00:29,651
Soli Deo Gloria means we are stewards of God's creation.

5
00:00:29,651 --> 00:00:38,272
Building high-performance AI that wastes megawatts of dirty electricity violates our core Christian ethics.

6
00:00:38,272 --> 00:00:42,059
TPU v8 delivers 3x higher performance-per-watt!

7
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:55,629
Look at Layer 2: "Optical Circuit Switching (OCS)." Instead of converting light to electrical signals and back, OCS routes raw light photons between TPU chips using micro-mirrors!

8
00:00:56,529 --> 00:00:59,441
That eliminates inter-chip communication lag!

9
00:00:59,441 --> 00:01:08,309
And Layer 3 delivers 4.5 exaflops of tensor power, allowing thousands of multi-agent swarms to run concurrently without queue throttling!

10
00:01:09,209 --> 00:01:15,329
True technical excellence is both computationally powerful and ecologically responsible.

